title: Bank Shot
text: Nothing may rest on the felt, and every cushion is a mirror. A shot only gets onto the table down the slant of a pocket, then plays off the cushions. Find the two shots that colour all three balls.
trick: a diagonal beam entering a square mirror table runs round an inscribed rectangle, so a target far from any opening is reached off the cushions; red's rectangle and blue's rectangle must cross exactly on the magenta ball, so the entry pockets are found by unfolding the bounces; a splitter and a doppler on the top rail give the two colours
motif: pictogram: a pool table: reflector cushions, conduit pockets (each passes one slant), corner blocks, felt of occupied squares, balls as targets
expect: shared>=3, recolours>=1
